# Maps misattributed commit identities back to the real author for `git log`/`shortlog`/
# `git blame` display, without rewriting any commit (no history rewrite on a public repo for
# a cosmetic issue). See docs/DECISION_LOG.md's 2026-10-10 entry for the root cause: a leaked
# GIT_DIR let test fixtures' own throwaway `git init`/`git config` land in this repo's real,
# shared .git/config, misattributing real work under identities meant only for synthetic test
# repos. Covers every bad identity found on `main` and reachable branches as of that incident.
